  "baseline_metadata": {
    "title": "Unofficial AI-Integrated Stacks Project — EGA I §6.5.4 semantic checkpoint",
    "publication_date": "2026-08-30",
    "description": "<p>This source-reproducible successor records the unofficial AI-integrated Stacks mapping and evidence work for EGA I §§6.5.2–6.5.4.</p><p>The generated R32 Stacks PDFs and their build-critical source bytes are unchanged from R32; this version adds semantic mapping, provenance, and validation evidence only. The incomplete EGA integration program continues in source order at EGA I §6.5.5.</p><p>This is independent, unofficial work. No Stacks Project affiliation, review, approval, or endorsement is claimed.</p>",
